    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Congratulations!</i></strong><i> You've been selected for reassignment to <strong>The Isola</strong> - a remote facility supporting vital intelligence operations at <strong>WE Inc.</strong> Your profile suggests <strong>an ideal fit</strong> for this unique position. WE looks forward to your cooperation. Best!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Your Loving Superiors @ WE Inc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>I Would Love to Wish You Good Morning</strong></i> is a choice-driven dystopian psychological horror visual novel with meaningful branching and a striking minimal brutalist aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Officer Oliver Kuleshov, recently rewarded with reassignment to the mysterious research facility known as <strong>The Isola</strong> - or as <strong>WE Inc.</strong> staff call it, <strong>&quot;The Wheel&quot;</strong> - stationed off the ringed planet <strong>Procris-9</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were promised a prestigious post, surrounded by brilliant minds and bold new ideas. But when you arrive, <u>the station is empty</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only coworker? A single artificially intelligent lifeform named <strong>FRIENDER</strong> - and something about him is\u2026 <i>off</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why weren\u2019t you told?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why were you really sent here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What exactly <i>is</i> this place?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short duration, with a ~2-2.5 hour golden path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story flow map that lets you revisit and replay from key choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized two-tone aesthetic inspired by modern brutalism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your choices\u2026 and your paranoia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack that pivots from serene to suffocating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable color palettes that give each conversation a new tone</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Congratulations!</i></strong><i> You've been selected for reassignment to <strong>The Isola</strong> - a remote facility supporting vital intelligence operations at <strong>WE Inc.</strong> Your profile suggests <strong>an ideal fit</strong> for this unique position. WE looks forward to your cooperation. Best!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Your Loving Superiors @ WE Inc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>I Would Love to Wish You Good Morning</strong></i> is a choice-driven dystopian psychological horror visual novel with meaningful branching and a striking minimal brutalist aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Officer Oliver Kuleshov, recently rewarded with reassignment to the mysterious research facility known as <strong>The Isola</strong> - or as <strong>WE Inc.</strong> staff call it, <strong>&quot;The Wheel&quot;</strong> - stationed off the ringed planet <strong>Procris-9</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were promised a prestigious post, surrounded by brilliant minds and bold new ideas. But when you arrive, <u>the station is empty</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only coworker? A single artificially intelligent lifeform named <strong>FRIENDER</strong> - and something about him is\u2026 <i>off</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why weren\u2019t you told?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why were you really sent here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What exactly <i>is</i> this place?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short duration, with a ~2-2.5 hour golden path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story flow map that lets you revisit and replay from key choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized two-tone aesthetic inspired by modern brutalism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your choices\u2026 and your paranoia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack that pivots from serene to suffocating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable color palettes that give each conversation a new tone</p></li></ul>",
