        ],
        "notes": "I Would Love to Wish You Good Morning is a psychological horror game that explores themes of isolation, manipulation, and mortality. It is not intended for children or those easily disturbed.\r\n\r\nThis game includes depictions of suicide, death, and psychological distress. It also contains references to substance abuse, self-harm, and emotional breakdowns as described in in-game logs. Some environmental elements may include stylized nudity in the form of sculptures or art.\r\n\r\nIf suicide or themes of psychological trauma are triggering for you, we recommend approaching the game with care, or choosing to avoid it altogether. "
